Package: mintcare
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, pkexec | policykit-1
Recommends: timeshift, ufw, udisks2, gir1.2-xapp-1.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, libnotify-bin
Suggests: smartmontools, flatpak
Description: Clean, optimise and repair Linux Mint
 MintCare diagnoses common problems (TCP BBR, broken packages, disk space,
 drivers, firewall, failed services, SMART health...) and fixes them, applies
 reversible performance tweaks and profiles, cleans junk, finds large and
 duplicate files, manages Flatpak permissions and schedules check-ups.
